WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.760
Watch and read: Which letter comes after B?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.360
The answer is: C. Alphabet order follows A, B, C, and so on.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.061
Watch and read: Which word begins with the sound /c/?

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:16.853
The answer is: cat. Listen to the beginning sound.
